DATA LICENCES AND ATTRIBUTION
The Carbon Ledger - offline data bundle

This repository ships a snapshot of public third-party data under data/raw and
the derived tables under data/interim so that the analysis can be reproduced
without contacting EPA, INPE, GBIF, OWID or the World Bank.  The pipeline code
(src/, sql/) and the written reports are original work.  The bundled data
remain subject to the terms of their publishers; this file records those terms
and the required attribution and grants no additional rights over them.

The same attributions are written into the `sources` table of
db/environmental.db by src/s07_build_db.py, so they travel with the database.


1. US EPA Greenhouse Gas Reporting Program (GHGRP), facility-level
   Licence : public domain (US government work)
   Source  : https://www.epa.gov/ghgreporting/data-sets
   Bundled : data/raw/ghgrp_2023_summary.zip
             data/raw/ghgrp/ghgp_data_2010.xlsx ... ghgp_data_2023.xlsx
   Note    : annual summary workbooks 2010-2023, all sheets carrying id and
             coordinates.

2. US EPA GHGRP, unit-level (subparts C, D, AA)
   Licence : public domain (US government work)
   Source  : https://www.epa.gov/system/files/other-files/2024-10/
             emissions_by_unit_and_fuel_type_c_d_aa.zip
   Bundled : data/raw/ghgrp/emissions_by_unit_and_fuel_type_c_d_aa.xlsb
   Note    : combustion units with nameplate capacity and fuel mix.

3. Science Based Targets initiative (SBTi) target register
   Licence : open data under SBTi terms of use
   Source  : https://sciencebasedtargets.org/target-dashboard
   Bundled : data/raw/sbti/sbti_targets.xlsx
             data/raw/sbti/sbti_companies.xlsx
   Note    : snapshot provided for reproducibility only; consult
             https://sciencebasedtargets.org/terms-of-use for current terms.

4. INPE PRODES, annual and accumulated deforestation (via TerraBrasilis)
   Licence : open (INPE / Brazilian public data)
   Source  : http://terrabrasilis.dpi.inpe.br/geoserver
   Bundled : data/raw/prodes/border_*.geojson
             data/raw/masks/*.npy
   Note    : the .npy files are 0.02 deg WMS rasterisations derived here, not
             the original vector geometry.

5. INPE PRODES official area (area_km attribute sweep)
   Licence : open (INPE)
   Source  : http://terrabrasilis.dpi.inpe.br/geoserver
   Bundled : data/interim/prodes_official_area.csv
             data/interim/prodes_annual_full.csv
             data/interim/prodes_year_sweep.json
             data/interim/prodes_layer_check.csv
   Note    : exact sums of the WFS area_km attribute, no geometry.

6. INPE DETER near-real-time alerts
   Licence : open (INPE)
   Source  : http://terrabrasilis.dpi.inpe.br/geoserver
   Bundled : data/interim/deter_alerts.csv
             data/interim/deter_biome_month.csv
             data/interim/deter_layer_counts.csv
   Note    : attributes only, no geometry.  Amazonia 2016+ and Cerrado 2018+;
             no DETER layer exists for the Atlantic Forest.

7. INPE BDQueimadas active-fire foci
   Licence : open (INPE)
   Source  : https://dataserver-coids.inpe.br/queimadas/
   Bundled : data/raw/fire/focos_br_ref_2003.zip ... focos_br_ref_2024.zip
   Note    : one reference satellite per year; the satellite changes across
             years, so level shifts can be instrument changes (see the report).

8. GBIF occurrence records
   Licence : CC0 or CC BY, per contributing dataset; each occurrence carries
             the licence of its own dataset publisher.
   Source  : https://api.gbif.org/v1
   Bundled : data/raw/gbif/gbif_*_raw*.csv and .meta.json
   Note    : datasetKey and institutionCode are retained so every record can be
             traced to its publisher and licence.  See
             https://www.gbif.org/terms/licences.  Required attribution: GBIF
             and the contributing dataset publishers.

9. Our World in Data / Global Carbon Budget CO2 panel
   Licence : CC BY 4.0
   Source  : https://github.com/owid/co2-data
   Bundled : data/raw/national/owid-co2-data.csv
   Required attribution: Our World in Data / Global Carbon Project.

10. World Bank indicators
    Licence : CC BY 4.0
    Source  : https://api.worldbank.org/v2
    Bundled : data/interim/wb_indicators.csv
    Required attribution: World Bank.  Indicators AG.LND.FRST.K2,
    AG.LND.FRST.ZS, ER.LND.PTLD.ZS, EG.ELC.RNEW.ZS.


REDISTRIBUTION NOTE

The bundle contains only what the pipeline needs to reproduce the 46 indicator
tables, 24 figures and the analysis report.  No 30 m raster stack, no modelled
substitutes for missing Scope 2/3 values, and no geometry downloads are
included.

Two large derived artifacts are deliberately NOT bundled and are rebuilt
locally from the files above:

    data/interim/fire_foci.csv   442 MB, from data/raw/fire/*.zip
    db/environmental.db          195 MB, from data/interim/*.csv

Both exceed the 100 MB single-file limit of ordinary Git hosts.  Every other
bundled file is under 50 MB.

For the sources that require attribution (OWID, World Bank, and the individual
GBIF datasets), cite the publisher as listed above when reusing the bundled
data.
